#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:5 e3a538eb540e4387ba5212e737c1a65c
msgid "RC Input (aka Pilot Input)"
msgstr "RC 输入（即飞手输入）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:7 abaee96895794b39929f1a38728b2d03
msgid ""
"Traditionally the pilot's manual input via an RC transmitter is sent to the "
"autopilot via a separate wireless link but it can alternatively be sent via "
"MAVLink.  This page describes the messages that can be used and gives advice"
" on some potential issues"
msgstr ""
"传统上，飞手通过遥控发射机的手动输入经由独立无线链路发送至飞控，但也可以通过 MAVLink 发送。本页描述了可使用的消息，并就一些潜在问题提供建议。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:9 d981dc8e5e8d4a31906448d5459b04ff
msgid "For reference here are some user focused RC related wiki pages:"
msgstr "以下是一些面向用户的 RC 相关 wiki 页面，供参考："

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:11 c73f086dcb2a4748ab9278055292da43
msgid ":ref:`Joystick/Gamepad setup <copter:common-joystick>`"
msgstr ":ref:`摇杆/游戏手柄设置 <copter:common-joystick>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:12 ca6f978b7d6742d89c527a60f30c659d
msgid ":ref:`RC Input Channel Mapping (aka RCMAP) <copter:common-rcmap>`"
msgstr ":ref:`RC 输入通道映射（即 RCMAP）<copter:common-rcmap>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:13 b9d5e0ce3fd24cff8a6ef6d9b8ca3499
msgid ":ref:`Auxiliary Functions <copter:common-auxiliary-functions>`"
msgstr ":ref:`辅助功能 <copter:common-auxiliary-functions>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:15 c0c877d9d52748afaaf75f90fef03917
msgid ""
"The autopilot will ignore the RC input messages if the sender's system id "
"does not match the autopilot's :ref:`MAV_GCS_SYSID <MAV_GCS_SYSID>` and "
":ref:`MAV_OPTIONS <MAV_OPTIONS>` = 1"
msgstr ""
"若发送方的系统 ID 与飞控的 :ref:`MAV_GCS_SYSID <MAV_GCS_SYSID>` 不匹配且 :ref:`MAV_OPTIONS "
"<MAV_OPTIONS>` = 1，飞控将忽略 RC 输入消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:17 923d5e653cd84a6f9620a0fbd503e4a0
msgid ""
"RC input via MAVlink typically results in a laggy response caused by "
"telemetry system lag and/or bandwidth limitations (these messages normally "
"share bandwidth with other MAVLink messages passed between GCS and the "
"vehicle)"
msgstr ""
"通过 MAVLink 输入 RC 信号通常会因数传系统延迟和/或带宽限制而导致响应迟滞（这些消息通常与地面站和飞行器之间传递的其他 MAVLink "
"消息共享带宽）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:19 7a73e2bb25b64d2782af126ada26eb21
msgid ""
"The Pilot's RC inputs can be monitored by the GCS or companion computer via "
"the `RC_CHANNELS <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#RC_CHANNELS>`__"
" message"
msgstr ""
"地面站或伴随计算机可通过 `RC_CHANNELS "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#RC_CHANNELS>`__ 消息监控飞手的 RC 输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:22 35f309b02ac34e27812947ff96d16905
msgid "RC_CHANNELS_OVERRIDE"
msgstr "RC_CHANNELS_OVERRIDE"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:24 c1e29130decc42528cf62b04d2641354
msgid ""
"The `RC_CHANNELS_OVERRIDE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#RC_CHANNELS_OVERRIDE>`__ message"
" allows setting the PWM equivalent value for each channel. This is normally "
"a value between 1000 and 2000 but ArduPilot's RC input library uses the "
"RCx_MIN, RCx_MAX and RCx_TRIM parameters to scale the input.  Note though "
"that these parameters are normally set by the user during the RC Calibration"
" stage."
msgstr ""
"`RC_CHANNELS_OVERRIDE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#RC_CHANNELS_OVERRIDE>`__ "
"消息允许为每个通道设置等效 PWM 值。通常该值在 1000 到 2000 之间，但 ArduPilot 的 RC 输入库使用 "
"RCx_MIN、RCx_MAX 和 RCx_TRIM 参数对输入进行缩放。注意，这些参数通常由用户在 RC 校准阶段设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:27 32fe2c84cf6f420a8d1e50ee9997c6b1
msgid ""
"If both a regular transmitter (e.g. Futaba, Spektrum, etc) which sends "
"actually PWM values and a MAVLink enabled RC input system (sending messages "
"via one of the message listed on this page) then care should be taken to "
"ensure the RCx_MIN/MAX ranges are consistent between the two systems. If the"
" MAVLink RC input stops, ArduPilot falls back to regular RC input within a "
"few seconds.  This timeout is configurable using the :ref:`RC_OVERRIDE_TIME "
"<copter:RC_OVERRIDE_TIME>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"如果同时使用发送实际 PWM 值的普通遥控器（如 Futaba、Spektrum 等）和启用 MAVLink 的 RC "
"输入系统（通过本页所列消息之一发送消息），则应注意确保两套系统之间的 RCx_MIN/MAX 范围一致。如果 MAVLink RC "
"输入停止，ArduPilot 会在几秒内回退到普通 RC 输入。该超时时间可通过 :ref:`RC_OVERRIDE_TIME "
"<copter:RC_OVERRIDE_TIME>` 参数配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:30 04cf52293fc7467a822f8aef37dace54
msgid ""
"Be careful not to change the flight mode inadvertently.  By default either "
"channel 5 or channel 8 (depending upon the vehicle type) is used to set the "
"flight mode but this can be disabled by setting :ref:`FLTMODE_CH "
"<copter:FLTMODE_CH>` or :ref:`MODE_CH <rover:MODE_CH>` to 0"
msgstr ""
"注意不要无意中更改飞行模式。默认情况下，通道 5 或通道 8（取决于飞行器类型）用于设置飞行模式，但可以通过将 :ref:`FLTMODE_CH "
"<copter:FLTMODE_CH>` 或 :ref:`MODE_CH <rover:MODE_CH>` 设置为 0 来禁用此功能。"

