#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:291 3c629a1e7d924573979789290f100ac3
msgid "Auxiliary Functions"
msgstr "辅助功能"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:293 930956e56fbd49229f2eb0375f19a756
msgid ""
"Auxiliary functions can be executed by sending a `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ or `COMMAND_INT"
" <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_INT>`__ message with "
"the \"command\" field set to `MAV_CMD_DO_AUX_FUNCTION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html#MAV_CMD_DO_AUX_FUNCTION>`__"
" (e.g. 218)"
msgstr ""
"辅助功能可通过发送 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ 或 `COMMAND_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_INT>`__ 消息，并将 「command」 "
"字段设置为 `MAV_CMD_DO_AUX_FUNCTION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html#MAV_CMD_DO_AUX_FUNCTION>`__"
" （如 218）来执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:295 1c8f4131a56841baa3cab52d79322690
msgid ""
"\"param1\" should be set to the auxiliary function.  The full list of "
"available functions can be found here on the user focused :ref:`Auxiliary "
"Functions page <copter:common-auxiliary-functions>`"
msgstr ""
"「param1」 应设置为辅助功能编号。可用功能的完整列表可在面向用户的 :ref:`辅助功能页面 <copter:common-auxiliary-"
"functions>` 上找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:296 f1c3bbf9995e4a6dbc8425e6c0ad2dd1
msgid ""
"\"param2\" should be set to 0:Switch Low (e.g deactivate function), 1:Switch"
" Middle or 2:Switch Highs (e.g. activate function)"
msgstr "「param2」 应设置为 0：开关低位（如停用功能），1：开关中位，或 2：开关高位（如激活功能）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:305 74e07fad5ae946e793ce8a1459492628
